{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path of the Abyss is a single-player, grid-based dungeon exploration RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore dungeons expressed in black-and-white pen drawings with your freely customized character and aim for the deepest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.poster.avif?t=1749827090\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.webm?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.mp4?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Unique Features* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFirst person RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbReal-time Combat that can be paused at any moment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDiverse Character Builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMany mysteries and loot to be uncovered in dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Combat*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat operates in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pause at any time so analyze your enemy\u2019s attacks, buff your allies, intercept enemy attacks and deploy a wide range of tactics to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to see what the enemy intends on doing. It is important to react with the appropriate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, you want to\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Pause and see how the enemy intends to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Choose the appropriate skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Unpause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat will be done by repeating these steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills you want to use in combat will be set into the \u201cFormation Panel\u201d formed by 9 panels, prior to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of combat will be affected greatly by the skills and the position of the skills you place on the Formation Panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Formation Panel will be shared by the party, a unique feature of this game is to come up with ways to use the limited number panels you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.poster.avif?t=1749827090\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.webm?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.mp4?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Character Builds*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build a character by customizing 8 abilities, 5 basic stats, skills and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Party Build*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build the party by setting up skills of the characters into the Formation Panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills have synergistic effects, and the Formation Panel should be set up so that the skills complement each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Exploration*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Path of the Abyss, you explore a world comprised by one giant dungeon and several minor dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the dungeons, strengthen your characters and make it to the the deepest depths of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Story*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small ruin in East Weltden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a forgotten ruin that has been robbed countless times, sightings of terrifying monsters became frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scoffed at the sightings as mere rumors, and ventured into the ruins to boast of their intrepidity, only to never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lord of East Weltden dispatched an investigation team but it only resulted in a bloodbath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors of this ruin traveled far and wide, luring skilled adventurers to the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are such an adventurer yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Video uploads/Streaming*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please post the URL of the Steam page for Path of the Abyss in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to monetize.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/53d69b9668946fb52a53ad31b688076359440eb4.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/d57443e33da2e6b9d0f18918593d8bafe15c7a3d.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/bbc4f2fc5edbb2110395030f2d698b53ecafd5bb.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/db6087a6490f618bb928be5b66dca26af25399d9.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/4ae15de45d48dbe01324642b51470c33fd96c08e.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/d57443e33da2e6b9d0f18918593d8bafe15c7a3d.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/3916d061c395dcad7f136c8fa42937ee56883228.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/3b6b13468ad119971b24928db4d8c27bd48b2005.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/844a112e3e860c3bf5a995d13cf1f4f9303a2c4f.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1768650/71da3505d3e1952ce8ebf885ed74d6a12d44b6f1.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1768650?t=1749827090","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749827090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749827090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749827090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Some monsters have exposed breasts"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Path of the Abyss is a single-player, grid-based dungeon exploration RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore dungeons expressed in black-and-white pen drawings with your freely customized character and aim for the deepest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.poster.avif?t=1749827090\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.webm?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/66bcee511afb3770444bb8feeaaca424.mp4?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Unique Features* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFirst person RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbReal-time Combat that can be paused at any moment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDiverse Character Builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMany mysteries and loot to be uncovered in dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Combat*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat operates in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pause at any time so analyze your enemy\u2019s attacks, buff your allies, intercept enemy attacks and deploy a wide range of tactics to gain an advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to see what the enemy intends on doing. It is important to react with the appropriate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, you want to\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Pause and see how the enemy intends to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Choose the appropriate skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Unpause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat will be done by repeating these steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills you want to use in combat will be set into the \u201cFormation Panel\u201d formed by 9 panels, prior to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of combat will be affected greatly by the skills and the position of the skills you place on the Formation Panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Formation Panel will be shared by the party, a unique feature of this game is to come up with ways to use the limited number panels you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.poster.avif?t=1749827090\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.webm?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/extras/bc49b1983e22e63c84ef5b9974a24a66.mp4?t=1749827090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Character Builds*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can build a character by customizing 8 abilities, 5 basic stats, skills and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Party Build*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build the party by setting up skills of the characters into the Formation Panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some skills have synergistic effects, and the Formation Panel should be set up so that the skills complement each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Exploration*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Path of the Abyss, you explore a world comprised by one giant dungeon and several minor dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the dungeons, strengthen your characters and make it to the the deepest depths of the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Story*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small ruin in East Weltden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a forgotten ruin that has been robbed countless times, sightings of terrifying monsters became frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scoffed at the sightings as mere rumors, and ventured into the ruins to boast of their intrepidity, only to never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lord of East Weltden dispatched an investigation team but it only resulted in a bloodbath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors of this ruin traveled far and wide, luring skilled adventurers to the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are such an adventurer yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Video uploads/Streaming*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please post the URL of the Steam page for Path of the Abyss in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to monetize.</p>","developers":["Suzuki Suzuzou"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1768650/header.jpg?t=1749827090","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1768650/404633/9ab36090c0fbd7c6f8a66d4b579475bdc5d1e671/1750733938/dash_av1.mpd?t=1738999283","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1768650/404633/9ab36090c0fbd7c6f8a66d4b579475bdc5d1e671/1750733938/dash_h264.mpd?t=1738999283","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1768650/404633/9ab36090c0fbd7c6f8a66d4b579475bdc5d1e671/1750733938/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1738999283","id":256853343,"name":"Path of the ABYSS PV01","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256853343/bc58b95dcd4983044fc0ce4ccb088516d26d45c0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738999283"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1768650/825073/112c52170abd664c19927abbff616f2b2f6a0588/1750733941/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739026030","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st